        "description": "Return an ordered list of available chronological contour timesteps.\nExcludes overall peak 'Maxima' envelopes.\n\nExample response:\n    [\"0930\", \"1030\", \"1130\", \"1230\", \"1330\", \"1430\", \"1530\", \"1630\", \"1730\"]",
        "operationId": "list_contour_timesteps_api_v1_contours_timesteps_get",
